WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:11.059
The least common PIN number is 8068.

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:16.450
To make them less conspicuous, white horses
in the British army during the First World

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.390
War were dyed brown with food colouring.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:25.650
The world's smallest advert was stencilled
onto a bee's knee.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.830
The caffeine extracted from decaf coffee is
sold to soft-drinks manufacturers.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:36.650
The first ever webcam was in the computer
lab at Cambridge University.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:41.620
It was permanently focused on the coffee pot
in the corridor to save the scientists making

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.539
pointless trips when it had run out.

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:49.710
There was a law in Sparta against having an
unmanly complexion.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.020
Palm trees are a type of grass.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:59.670
Before humans reached Hawaii, the dominant
animals there were giant ducks.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.809
Winston Churchill was a druid.

00:01:02.809 --> 00:01:07.880
One in eleven people on Earth earn their money
from tourism.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:14.260
Medieval peasants ate about 4,000 calories
per day, twice as many calories as the average

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.150
person eats today.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:21.800
People are more likely to co-operate with
you if you give them something warm to hold.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:28.040
A grasshopper becomes more sociable if you
stroke its hind legs.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:32.680
Wamblecropt is a 17th-century word for 'indigestion'.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:38.440
The amount of times you need to push down
per minute during CPR is the beat of the song

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:42.720
Staying Alive or Another one Bites the Dust.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:50.720
Victorian slang for a woman's breasts was
'Cupid's kettledrums'.

